cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference DoseDNA, please cite it as below. This is a hackathon
  research prototype (see README "Status" and "Not medical advice"), not a
  peer-reviewed publication.
title: DoseDNA
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/alejandro-publius/dosedna
url: https://alejandro-publius.github.io/dosedna/
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first pharmacogenomics chat agent that reads a 23andMe or
  AncestryDNA file in the browser, calls phenotypes with a deterministic
  engine grounded in PharmVar variant tables and CPIC diplotype tables,
  fetches CPIC's live clinical recommendation, and answers in plain
  language. Built for AI Hackathon 2026 at Berkeley.
